<title>UK: GOLF-EUROPEAN GRAND PRIX FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-EUROPEAN GRAND PRIX FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>HEXHAM, England 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
